    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8445" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνεπί-τακτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>subject to no control,</i>
			
