				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					7.69
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.987b
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>
			<i>without orders</i> or <i>command,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				19.2.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				5.20
			</span></i>.</div>
